00:02:21,610 --> 00:02:23,980
We design a range of product formats.

26
00:02:24,450 --> 00:02:33,420
Since numerous experts and end users reported more growth in the ventilation system, we especially focused on developing the anti-mode AC filter.

27
00:02:34,310 --> 00:02:41,230
To do this, we've used additional CBM modules onto our enzymes, allowing our enzymes to bind tightly to AC filter materials.

28
00:02:41,640 --> 00:02:53,550
This design is again highly successful as our CBM modules displayed strong affinity to many kinds of fibers, polymers, and surprisingly increased our enzymes' chitinolytic activity and hydrolytic activity.

29
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:57,330
We also innovated on the synthesis of geranium.

30
00:02:57,830 --> 00:03:09,260
By truncating the first 65 amino acids of the geranial synthase, we achieved the final geranial yield of 0.157 g/L. This is nearly 3-fold compared to the untrancated version.

31
00:03:09,770 --> 00:03:16,300
We also synthesized gamma cyclodextrin to encapsulate the geranial allowing our geranial to have better solubility and stability.

32
00:03:17,700 --> 00:03:29,390
From the very start of our investigation, we realized that a critical gap exists between public perception and scientific reality for synthetic biology. Thus, we set out to share our passion and knowledge to everybody.

33
00:03:30,340 --> 00:03:37,230
